{"id":"osen_yu","lemma":"осенью","pos":"adv","rank":3807,"glosses":["in autumn"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c1/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%8C%D1%8E.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%8C%D1%8E.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Том не сделает этого этой осенью.","en":"Tom won't do that this fall.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},null,null,null]},{"text":"Я сделаю это следующей осенью.","en":"I'm going to do that next fall.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,null]},{"text":"Она этой осенью выходит замуж.","en":"She is getting married this fall.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},null,null,{"g":"to go out","l":"выходить"},{"g":"married"}]},{"text":"Дети снова пойдут в школу осенью.","en":"Children go back to school in autumn.","words":[{"g":"child","l":"ребёнок"},{"g":"anew"},{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"},{"g":"in"},null,null]},{"text":"Они поженились прошлой осенью.","en":"They got married last fall.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to marry .","l":"пожениться"},null,null]}]}